(7325621, 1143809, 84668, '<td valign="top">Wrong time of the day. The light should be hitting the subject in this case. 90% of the subject is in the shadows, which does not help in this case. Nice place and good idea anyway. 5</td>', 'Wrong time of the day. The light should be hitting the subject in this case. 90% of the subject is in the shadows, which does not help in this case. Nice place and good idea anyway. 5', '2015-03-09 13:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
