(7325623, 1143449, 84668, '<td valign="top">There is some weird softness on the feathers, together with some weird sharpness and contrast on the vegetation. Don''t know, but even liking the composition and idea, something does not work IMO. 5.</td>', 'There is some weird softness on the feathers, together with some weird sharpness and contrast on the vegetation. Don''t know, but even liking the composition and idea, something does not work IMO. 5.', '2015-03-09 13:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325624, 1143713, 84668, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, like it. Composition and idea are preety good. Interestingly, the only person without a cell phone in the picture is the one wearing black, but it seems she is looking for it on the bag. The over saturated reds annoy me a bit, for that reason, lowering from 7 to 6.</td>', 'Oh yeah, like it. Composition and idea are preety good. Interestingly, the only person without a cell phone in the picture is the one wearing black, but it seems she is looking for it on the bag. The over saturated reds annoy me a bit, for that reason, lowering from 7 to 6.', '2015-03-09 13:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325628, 1143672, 84668, '<td valign="top">I like it, specially the fact the he seems to be looking at you. I think a clean converse would make it better, together with some fill in the left. 5</td>', 'I like it, specially the fact the he seems to be looking at you. I think a clean converse would make it better, together with some fill in the left. 5', '2015-03-09 13:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
