(7325762, 1143759, 114285, '<td valign="top">I like the funky processing, but it doesn''t give me the impression of being shot from above.</td>', 'I like the funky processing, but it doesn''t give me the impression of being shot from above.', '2015-03-10 02:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325763, 1143717, 114285, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an unusual style of PP, great scene, and meets the challenge. Would of loved it in black and white maybe.</td>', 'Now that''s an unusual style of PP, great scene, and meets the challenge. Would of loved it in black and white maybe.', '2015-03-10 02:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325765, 1143835, 114285, '<td valign="top">Has that guy got his PJ''s on? I do believe it looks like it. Too much saturation and sharpness for my liking..and a little contrived! The scene itself is quite geometrical.</td>', 'Has that guy got his PJ''s on? I do believe it looks like it. Too much saturation and sharpness for my liking..and a little contrived! The scene itself is quite geometrical.', '2015-03-10 02:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325766, 1143842, 114285, '<td valign="top">Quite the conundrum here, is that the shadow or another horse, good find!</td>', 'Quite the conundrum here, is that the shadow or another horse, good find!', '2015-03-10 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325768, 1143742, 114285, '<td valign="top">I think this is the winner. Gorgeous view, beautiful entrancing sunset, soft fluffy clouds, DPC loves this sort of stuff.</td>', 'I think this is the winner. Gorgeous view, beautiful entrancing sunset, soft fluffy clouds, DPC loves this sort of stuff.', '2015-03-10 02:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325790, 1143842, 38032, '<td valign="top">stellar. had to do a double-take. Gotta wonder how you would get this one.</td>', 'stellar. had to do a double-take. Gotta wonder how you would get this one.', '2015-03-10 07:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325791, 1143717, 38032, '<td valign="top">interesting editing. Part of me thinks it is overdone but it also has a unique quality to it not usually seen in HDR. Some good leading lines and nice comp as well.</td>', 'interesting editing. Part of me thinks it is overdone but it also has a unique quality to it not usually seen in HDR. Some good leading lines and nice comp as well.', '2015-03-10 07:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325792, 1143807, 38032, '<td valign="top">VEry pleasing to look at. Love the clean yellow lines among the dingy atmosphere.</td>', 'VEry pleasing to look at. Love the clean yellow lines among the dingy atmosphere.', '2015-03-10 07:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325793, 1143784, 38032, '<td valign="top">Just when I was about to give up. Everything was numb. My breathing had gone from panicked and fast to slow and it was as if I was about to go into permanent hibernation. A glimpse of red. Warmth. Hope. Just a few steps away. I knew I could make it. 8</td>', 'Just when I was about to give up. Everything was numb. My breathing had gone from panicked and fast to slow and it was as if I was about to go into permanent hibernation. A glimpse of red. Warmth. Hope. Just a few steps away. I knew I could make it. 8', '2015-03-10 07:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325794, 1143860, 38032, '<td valign="top">vertigo-inducing. Not without metaphor. Begs to be seen in color and from many angles.</td>', 'vertigo-inducing. Not without metaphor. Begs to be seen in color and from many angles.', '2015-03-10 07:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325795, 1143704, 38032, '<td valign="top">Fun shot with a nice composition.</td>', 'Fun shot with a nice composition.', '2015-03-10 07:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325796, 1143751, 38032, '<td valign="top">A wonderful and thoughtful sketch.</td>', 'A wonderful and thoughtful sketch.', '2015-03-10 07:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325804, 1143842, 177322, '<td valign="top">Such a playfully deceiving PoV. Six for true ingenuity.</td>', 'Such a playfully deceiving PoV. Six for true ingenuity.', '2015-03-10 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325892, 1143675, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, engagingly forlorn.  The composition is superb, and I love how the pigeons connect the two men.  The brickwork is like an added texture, but it''s real.  The benches look like amoebae having just separated and drifting apart.  My personal favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent image, engagingly forlorn.  The composition is superb, and I love how the pigeons connect the two men.  The brickwork is like an added texture, but it''s real.  The benches look like amoebae having just separated and drifting apart.  My personal favorite in the challenge.', '2015-03-10 16:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325893, 1143887, 173844, '<td valign="top">So engaging and playful.  That piece of turkey has a perfect amount of blur.  I love the intensity dogs bring to food.  My personal second favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'So engaging and playful.  That piece of turkey has a perfect amount of blur.  I love the intensity dogs bring to food.  My personal second favorite in the challenge.', '2015-03-10 16:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325895, 1143742, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine wide angle shot in which the young man is actually portrayed looking down and across the expansive.  I''m imagining that he''s looking over his home town.  The lovely sunset adds to the poignancy of the scene.  A more elegant positioning of the shirt on the railing would help the image.</td>', 'Fine wide angle shot in which the young man is actually portrayed looking down and across the expansive.  I''m imagining that he''s looking over his home town.  The lovely sunset adds to the poignancy of the scene.  A more elegant positioning of the shirt on the railing would help the image.', '2015-03-10 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325896, 1143762, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the business of the buildings and the very high sharpness of the midground rock formations.  The latter seem to loom in a pleasantly ominous fashion.  The populated valley floor looks like a mosaic.  A lot to take in.</td>', 'I like the business of the buildings and the very high sharpness of the midground rock formations.  The latter seem to loom in a pleasantly ominous fashion.  The populated valley floor looks like a mosaic.  A lot to take in.', '2015-03-10 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325897, 1143694, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice otherworldly atmosphere to this modestly contoured scene with water.  I especially like the foreground vegetation, dead and alive.</td>', 'Nice otherworldly atmosphere to this modestly contoured scene with water.  I especially like the foreground vegetation, dead and alive.', '2015-03-10 16:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325898, 1143859, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific dizzying perspective with all that complexity of lines tending towards a vanishing point.  There''s also a satisfying harmony of modest color tones.</td>', 'Terrific dizzying perspective with all that complexity of lines tending towards a vanishing point.  There''s also a satisfying harmony of modest color tones.', '2015-03-10 17:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325918, 1143727, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lol, yes I know what you mean, I''m an in and out sort of person, but as for my   daughter she wants to look at everything, so I can relate to this!<br/> <br/>Edited for typo ;)</td>', 'Lol, yes I know what you mean, I''m an in and out sort of person, but as for my   daughter she wants to look at everything, so I can relate to this! Edited for typo ;)', '2015-03-10 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326066, 1143818, 48710, '<td valign="top">striking edit of figures with background.</td>', 'striking edit of figures with background.', '2015-03-11 10:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326067, 1143859, 48710, '<td valign="top">Unexpected color cast - surreal telegraph pole and car - made this one worth a second look...</td>', 'Unexpected color cast - surreal telegraph pole and car - made this one worth a second look...', '2015-03-11 10:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326069, 1143717, 48710, '<td valign="top">evocative of a school poster, nicely done.</td>', 'evocative of a school poster, nicely done.', '2015-03-11 10:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326086, 1143908, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine, fleeting and unusual capture of this pigeon.  I like the composition that uses negative space to enhance the sensation of catching movement out of the corner of one''s eye.  Seems to emerge from the background.</td>', 'Fine, fleeting and unusual capture of this pigeon.  I like the composition that uses negative space to enhance the sensation of catching movement out of the corner of one''s eye.  Seems to emerge from the background.', '2015-03-11 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326090, 1143781, 173844, '<td valign="top">Much more than bright colors, though these are fun, there''s a lot of human story going on here, much of it implied, left to the imagination. What to make of the man with his tattooed arms, serving a platter to an empty counter, a large knife, undoubtedly a tool of the trade, resting ominously in front of him, and the anonymity of a cheese head?  What is the woman''s emotional state?  What''s she holding in her hand?  Do they have enough ketchup?  It''s all very enjoyable.</td>', 'Much more than bright colors, though these are fun, there''s a lot of human story going on here, much of it implied, left to the imagination. What to make of the man with his tattooed arms, serving a platter to an empty counter, a large knife, undoubtedly a tool of the trade, resting ominously in front of him, and the anonymity of a cheese head?  What is the woman''s emotional state?  What''s she holding in her hand?  Do they have enough ketchup?  It''s all very enjoyable.', '2015-03-11 11:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326118, 1143811, 62357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful spring day.</td>', 'Beautiful spring day.', '2015-03-11 14:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326168, 1143859, 37719, '<td valign="top">It took a second, but I love this view! Well done.</td>', 'It took a second, but I love this view! Well done.', '2015-03-11 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326169, 1143837, 37719, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2015-03-11 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326171, 1143717, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the artistic processing here.  Nice capture!</td>', 'I like the artistic processing here.  Nice capture!', '2015-03-11 20:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326172, 1143810, 37719, '<td valign="top">A bit hard on the eyes.</td>', 'A bit hard on the eyes.', '2015-03-11 20:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326174, 1143899, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2015-03-11 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326177, 1143751, 173844, '<td valign="top">Motion blur, life rushing by... that''s fine.  What I really love here is how the somewhat distinct tombstones in the lower foreground give way to the less distinct ones above, which are very much like leaves being blown off the tree branches.  That transition is lovely.</td>', 'Motion blur, life rushing by... that''s fine.  What I really love here is how the somewhat distinct tombstones in the lower foreground give way to the less distinct ones above, which are very much like leaves being blown off the tree branches.  That transition is lovely.', '2015-03-11 21:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
