(7327284, 1143759, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had a couple of shots at an angle like this and didn''t choose them because I thought people would not see it as "looking down" enough. It is clearly shot from a height above the river, however. I''ll be interested to see how this sits with the collective.</td>', 'I had a couple of shots at an angle like this and didn''t choose them because I thought people would not see it as "looking down" enough. It is clearly shot from a height above the river, however. I''ll be interested to see how this sits with the collective.', '2015-03-15 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
