(7327414, 1143726, 94815, '<td valign="top">This has an immediate effect of disorientation, almost Escheresque, but soon becomes clear that it is flipped and leaves an uncomfortable feeling.  Reflipped, it is a revelation: a perfectly constructed, rationally disorienting view from above without the stomach turning aftereffect. Regrettably I can''t rate it high even when it could have been a favorite as originally shot.</td>', 'This has an immediate effect of disorientation, almost Escheresque, but soon becomes clear that it is flipped and leaves an uncomfortable feeling.  Reflipped, it is a revelation: a perfectly constructed, rationally disorienting view from above without the stomach turning aftereffect. Regrettably I can''t rate it high even when it could have been a favorite as originally shot.', '2015-03-15 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
